          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\sigma$ is known, so use the Z interval $\\bar{x} \\pm z_{0.025}\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}} = 64.46 \\pm 1.96 \\times \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} = 64.46 \\pm 1.96(0.3162) = 64.46 \\pm 0.6198$. That gives $(63.8402,\\ 65.0798)$. (Option B uses $z_{0.05}=1.645$, which would be a 90% interval, not 95%.)</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Đã biết $\\sigma$ nên dùng khoảng Z: $\\bar{x} \\pm z_{0.025}\\dfrac{\\sigma}{\\sqrt{n}} = 64.46 \\pm 1.96 \\times \\dfrac{1}{\\sqrt{10}} = 64.46 \\pm 1.96(0.3162) = 64.46 \\pm 0.6198$, tức $(63.8402,\\ 65.0798)$. (Phương án B dùng $z_{0.05}=1.645$, đó là khoảng 90% chứ không phải 95%.)</p></div>"
